    {"id":"oldtext","type":"text","x":65,"y":140,"width":700,"height":720,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#172033","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a4","roundness":null,"seed":5,"version":1,"versionNonce":105,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788048000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"BEFORE — origin/main scalar packed prefix\n\nscore_f32 allocation: 16 f32 cells\nlogical live view: [bsz=2][G=2][N=2]\n\n[b0g0:2][b0g1:2][b1g0:2][b1g1:2][zero tail:8]\nbases = 0, 2, 4, 6\n\nMAX / SUM DSD WALK\nbind base score[0], length N once\nfor i in 0..bsz*G:\n  reduce current DSD -> slot[i]\n  increment DSD offset by N\n\nOUTPUT ORDER (fixed)\n[max/sum b0g0][b0g1][b1g0][b1g1]\nY max all-reduce extent = bsz*G = 4 f32\n\nWHY IT WORKS\nEvery group has the same scalar width N.\nIt cannot represent request-local [1,3].","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"BEFORE — origin/main scalar packed prefix\n\nscore_f32 allocation: 16 f32 cells\nlogical live view: [bsz=2][G=2][N=2]\n\n[b0g0:2][b0g1:2][b1g0:2][b1g1:2][zero tail:8]\nbases = 0, 2, 4, 6\n\nMAX / SUM DSD WALK\nbind base score[0], length N once\nfor i in 0..bsz*G:\n  reduce current DSD -> slot[i]\n  increment DSD offset by N\n\nOUTPUT ORDER (fixed)\n[max/sum b0g0][b0g1][b1g0][b1g1]\nY max all-reduce extent = bsz*G = 4 f32\n\nWHY IT WORKS\nEvery group has the same scalar width N.\nIt cannot represent request-local [1,3].","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"newtext","type":"text","x":860,"y":140,"width":700,"height":750,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#172033","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a5","roundness":null,"seed":6,"version":2,"versionNonce":206,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788134400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"AFTER — fixed request segments, packed groups\n\nscore_f32 allocation: same 16 cells\nrequest base = b*G*C; each segment has 8 cells\n\nrequest 0: [b0g0:1][b0g1:1][zero tail:6]\nrequest 1: [b1g0:3][b1g1:3][zero tail:2]\ngroup bases = 0, 1, 8, 11\n\nIMPLEMENTED MAX / SUM WALK\nfor b:\n  L = current_len(position[b], local_py)\n  if L > 0: bind request base once, length L\n    for g: reduce -> slot[b,g]; increment by L\n  else: fill max=-inf or sum=0 for G slots\n\nOUTPUT ORDER / Y COLLECTIVE: unchanged\n\nWHY THIS SHAPE\nOne necessary reset per request boundary.\nNo per-group base reset. For bsz=1, the hot\nreduction walk matches main except position+branch.\nRuntime impact remains unknown.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"AFTER — fixed request segments, packed groups\n\nscore_f32 allocation: same 16 cells\nrequest base = b*G*C; each segment has 8 cells\n\nrequest 0: [b0g0:1][b0g1:1][zero tail:6]\nrequest 1: [b1g0:3][b1g1:3][zero tail:2]\ngroup bases = 0, 1, 8, 11\n\nIMPLEMENTED MAX / SUM WALK\nfor b:\n  L = current_len(position[b], local_py)\n  if L > 0: bind request base once, length L\n    for g: reduce -> slot[b,g]; increment by L\n  else: fill max=-inf or sum=0 for G slots\n\nOUTPUT ORDER / Y COLLECTIVE: unchanged\n\nWHY THIS SHAPE\nOne necessary reset per request boundary.\nNo per-group base reset. For bsz=1, the hot\nreduction walk matches main except position+branch.\nRuntime impact remains unknown.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
